        "Content": "<ul><li>Outstanding Detached 4 bed property with good gardens front and rear</li><li>Wonderfully presented throughout</li><li>Superbly converted garage giving second reception room and utility room</li><li>Large bright rooms giving wonderful living accommodation</li><li>Separate kitchen and dining room to the rear</li><li>Gas boiler & composite front door</li><li>Private rear garden with dual side entrances</li><li>Extensive decking area to the rear</li><li>Front garden with ample off street parking</li><li>Double glazed uPVC windows</li><li>Much sought after cul de sac estate close to Balbriggan Golf Club</li><li>Ideally located between Balrothery village and Balbriggan town</ul>"
